<title>POLAND: ELEKTRIM SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 6.95 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTRIM SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 6.95 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> SEPTEMBER		1996	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.95 vs  22.29</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	17.75 vs 120.26</p>
<p> Operating loss	 2.09 vs  16.58 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   76.99 vs  53.34</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    28.96 vs  42.60</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit     153.94 vs 172.80</p>
<p> Operating profit    24.20 vs  40.11</p>
<p> Sales		  648.95 vs 426.71</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish industrial and trading</p>
<p>conglomerate is Elektrim SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
